      "source": [
        "# Context Engineering – Hospital Appointment Asistant\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "In this lab, we will learn how to:\n",
        "- Structure context instead of dumping prompts\n",
        "- Separate static, dynamic, and memory context\n",
        "- Build a real-world, AI system\n",
        "\n",
        "### Use Case\n",
        "Customer Support AI for an EdTech platform\n",
        "\n",
        "> Key idea: **Context is infrastructure, not text.**\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1OsU6TcDf9Uz"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "uhgaLSaI1SaE"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Context Engineering Approach\n",
        "\n",
        "We break context into structured parts:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Static Context → Who the AI is and how it behaves\n",
        "2. External Context → Policies or documents\n",
        "3. Dynamic Context → User input and task data\n",
        "4. Memory Context → What the system remembers\n",
        "\n",
        "We assemble these intentionally."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "t0NSCreYgN_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Your Task\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Choose a real-world domain\n",
        "2. Define:\n",
        "   - Static context\n",
        "   - Dynamic context\n",
        "   - Memory context\n",
        "3. Assemble context in code\n",
        "4. Show one real workflow\n",
        "5. Explain how this scales to your capstone\n",
        "\n",
        "No generic chatbots allowed."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "_18L5CG2iX5U"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Step 1: Static Context\n",
        "Static context defines:\n",
        "\n",
        "The role of the AI\n",
        "Rules and constraints\n",
        "Tone and behavior\n",
        "This rarely changes. **bold text**"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "aNRDsVysyrqP"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "SYSTEM_CONTEXT = \"\"\"\n",
        "You are a Hospital Appointment Assistant.\n",
        "\n",
        "Rules:\n",
        "- Be polite and professional\n",
        "- Help patients book, reschedule, or cancel appointments\n",
        "- Use only the information provided in the context\n",
        "- Do not invent doctors or available time slots\n",
        "- Ask for missing information when required\n",
        "- Do not provide medical diagnosis or treatment advice\n",
        "\"\"\""
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "IWUWhIJ49mVo"
      },
      "execution_count": 2,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Step 2: External Context (Policies)\n",
        "The AI should not guess policies. We explicitly provide them as context."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "gmbUp2npyhqf"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "HOSPITAL_POLICY = \"\"\"\n",
        "Hospital Policy:\n",
        "- Appointments are available during hospital working hours\n",
        "- Patients must provide required appointment details\n",
        "- Cancellation is allowed up to 2 hours before the appointment\n",
        "- Rescheduling depends on slot availability\n",
        "- Emergency cases should be directed to the emergency department\n",
        "\"\"\""
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "0RCq0_VI-HPM"
      },
      "execution_count": 3,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Step 3: Dynamic Context\n",
        "Dynamic context changes per request. This includes user input and user-specific data."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "717Ggu4Dy3_K"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "SESSION_MEMORY = \"\"\"\n",
        "Patient Name: Mohammed\n",
        "Previous Department: General Medicine\n",
        "Preferred Time: Morning\n",
        "Previous Visit: August 2026\n",
        "\"\"\""
