    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Step 4: Context Assembly\n",
        "We now assemble the context carefully. Order and clarity matter. This is context engineering."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "jkb2KK0ry-JA"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "final_prompt_with_memory = f\"\"\"\n",
